NOTE ON THE HARDWARE

This project involves mains-free but still hazardous equipment: lithium cells
under load, motors that can start unexpectedly, and wheels that can catch
fingers. The MIT license above covers the software and the documentation only.

It is not a warranty of any kind, and specifically not a safety guarantee. No
figure in this repository — current draw, runtime, cell capacity, detection
range — has been measured under load. Build and test it yourself, follow the
pre-power checklist in docs/12_Final_Implementation.md, and keep the battery
within reach of a hand while the robot is powered.
